        { "left": "yelu", "right": "7" },
        { "left": "ettu", "right": "8" }
      ],
      "explanation": "Numbers 5 through 8 — practice saying them aloud to build muscle memory."
    },
    {
      "id": "ta-s2-l5-ex03",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "question": "What is 'pathu' in English?",
      "options": ["8", "9", "10", "7"],
      "correctIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "'Pathu' means 10. 'Ombadu' is 9. Together: ombadu, pathu (9, 10)."
    },
    {
      "id": "ta-s2-l5-ex04",
      "type": "translation",
      "prompt": "5",
      "direction": "from_english",
